{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Way of the Tray demo you will have access to the first 7 game days and 6 yokai patrons, as well as the opportunity to improve the skills of your character and decorate the restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Way of the Tray </strong>is a waiter simulator with action puzzle elements in a Japanese spirit world setting. After accidentally falling into the mystical world of spirits, you find yourself in a difficult situation: to find your way home, you will have to work in a local restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/Become_a_master_of_serving_dishes!.png?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/WotT_2_v2.gif?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of keeping your tray balanced: every mistake can cost you a tip. Learn to manage your time so you can serve all your guests on time and prevent them from leaving because of long waiting time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/Learn_about_Japanese_culture!.png?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/WotT_3_v2.gif?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the mysterious atmosphere of Japan: serve unusual orders to yokai and learn all the secrets of local cuisine. Serve dishes that even mysterious spirits can enjoy. Today\u2019s menu includes onigiri, sushi and ramen, and fortune cookies for dessert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/Improve_the_interior_and_service!.png?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/WotT_4_v3.gif?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your waiter skills to earn more tips and invest them in upgrades, and don\u2019t forget to pay the rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to make your way as a waiter in the mysterious world of Japanese spirits? Keep your balance, solve puzzles and find your way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650760?t=1745908874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650760?t=1745908874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/b259b5d248ff848f7ac6356a6b5027bb3ff0ce38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745908874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/b259b5d248ff848f7ac6356a6b5027bb3ff0ce38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745908874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Way of the Tray demo you will have access to the first 7 game days and 6 yokai patrons, as well as the opportunity to improve the skills of your character and decorate the restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Way of the Tray </strong>is a waiter simulator with action puzzle elements in a Japanese spirit world setting. After accidentally falling into the mystical world of spirits, you find yourself in a difficult situation: to find your way home, you will have to work in a local restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/Become_a_master_of_serving_dishes!.png?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/WotT_2_v2.gif?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of keeping your tray balanced: every mistake can cost you a tip. Learn to manage your time so you can serve all your guests on time and prevent them from leaving because of long waiting time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/Learn_about_Japanese_culture!.png?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/WotT_3_v2.gif?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the mysterious atmosphere of Japan: serve unusual orders to yokai and learn all the secrets of local cuisine. Serve dishes that even mysterious spirits can enjoy. Today\u2019s menu includes onigiri, sushi and ramen, and fortune cookies for dessert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/Improve_the_interior_and_service!.png?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650760/extras/WotT_4_v3.gif?t=1745908874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your waiter skills to earn more tips and invest them in upgrades, and don\u2019t forget to pay the rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to make your way as a waiter in the mysterious world of Japanese spirits? Keep your balance, solve puzzles and find your way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Who is Terry?"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3373830","na